Advanced #Terraform interview questions.

Part-1

---
1. Difference between terraform import and terraform taint

terraform import → Brings an existing resource (created outside Terraform) under Terraform management.
Example: Import an AWS EC2 instance:

terraform import aws_instance.my_ec2 i-1234567890abcdef

terraform taint → Marks a resource for re-creation in the next apply.
Example:

terraform taint aws_instance.my_ec2
terraform apply   # destroys and recreates the resource

